	(text "U4: VOUT = 1.23 V x (1 + R7 / R8) = 13.5 V, 1.6 MHz.\nU7: VOUT = 100 uA x R11 = 12.0 V; PG opens above 11 V (R12, R14).\nU5: VOUT = -1.22 V x (R9 + R10) / R10 = -3.98 V; R5 keeps VBUS transients off its 5.8 V rating.\nPWR_GOOD is pulled up to +3V3_C: with the carrier unpowered it reads low."
